OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers and
OL,6,Fcloud clearing inland allowing
OL,7,Ftemperatures to fall and a touch of
OL,8,Fair frost in rural spots to form.
OL,9,FStaying cloudier and milder along the
OL,10,Fcoast, with isolated showers slower to
OL,11,Fclear.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA bright and chilly start
OL,14,Ffor most, with rural frost. Isolated
OL,15,Fcoastal showers across the south
OL,16,Fduring the morning. Clouding over,
OL,17,Fwith rain arriving overnight
OL,18,Faccompanied by stronger winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
